        "hook": "In 1848, she escaped *disguised as a white slave owner.*"
      },
      "captions": false
    },
    {
      "id": "husband",
      "text": "And her husband? He played her slave.",
      "visual": {
        "kind": "card",
        "image": "couple",
        "crop": [
          0.52,
          0.0,
          0.92,
          0.75
        ],
